2088:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c **** /**
2089:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @brief  Configures the selected MAC address.
2090:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @param  heth pointer to a ETH_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
2091:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *         the configuration information for ETHERNET module
2092:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @param  MacAddr The MAC address to configure
2093:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
2094:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *             @arg ETH_MAC_Address0: MAC Address0 
2095:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *             @arg ETH_MAC_Address1: MAC Address1 
2096:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *             @arg ETH_MAC_Address2: MAC Address2
2097:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   *             @arg ETH_MAC_Address3: MAC Address3
2098:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_eth.c ****   * @param  Addr Pointer to MAC address buffer data (6 bytes)
